				"description": "Rewrites the text into tariff wording, searches a vector index of every declarable code and reranks the candidates with an LLM. `fast` takes about 3-5 s and costs 1 AI unit; `accurate` takes 6-30 s, costs 5 and adds confidence and reasoning. If the rerank fails or times out, results come in vector order with `reranked: false`. Advisory only, see `disclaimer`.",
